WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.875
In the opening verses of Chapter 15,

2
00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:39.750
Lord Krishna used the metaphor
of the inverted Ashwattha tree

3
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:44.375
to show how entangled and
impermanent this world is.

4
00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:47.125
Then He explained the means to come out

5
00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:51.708
of this bondage – vairagya and surrender.

6
00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:54.791
Now in verse 15.5 He describes

7
00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:58.625
which qualities and way of life

8
00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:01.750
allow a person to truly become free from this world

9
00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.750
and reach that eternal abode.

10
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:10.875
The path to liberation

11
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:13.291
begins with humility.

12
00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:16.125
Nirmanamohah –

13
00:01:16.125 --> 00:01:17.250
those seekers

14
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:21.000
who have become free from ego and delusion.

15
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.291
Pride gives us the illusion

16
00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:25.958
that we control everything,

17
00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:28.041
while in reality prakriti

18
00:01:28.041 --> 00:01:31.125
tosses us about

19
00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:33.791
like leaves in a storm.

20
00:01:33.791 --> 00:01:36.625
When the soul accepts that

21
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:39.833
it is not the master of this world,

22
00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.833
only then does true power appear.

23
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:46.083
Pride is an obstacle to surrender,

24
00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:49.708
but humility opens the heart.

25
00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:53.125
Next comes jitasangadoshah –

26
00:01:53.125 --> 00:01:54.750
those who have

27
00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:56.208
overcome the faults

28
00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:58.750
born of attachment.

29
00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.750
Attachments bind us again and again

30
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:04.541
in the same actions and reactions.

31
00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:07.541
When we give up the false belief

32
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:08.916
that some person,

33
00:02:08.916 --> 00:02:12.208
thing, or position will make us complete,

34
00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:16.958
lightness and freedom both come within.

35
00:02:16.958 --> 00:02:19.583
Adhyatmanityah –

36
00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:21.250
those who remain continuously

37
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.083
absorbed in spiritual contemplation.

38
00:02:23.083 --> 00:02:23.833
Their life

39
00:02:23.833 --> 00:02:26.875
is not limited to rituals alone,

40
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:28.958
but moves with the remembrance

41
00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:32.875
of God’s presence in every moment.

42
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:36.166
Vinivritta-kamah –

43
00:02:36.166 --> 00:02:40.125
those who have withdrawn from
material desires.

44
00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:43.458
This does not mean abandoning life, but

45
00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:44.958
abandoning the tendency

46
00:02:44.958 --> 00:02:47.666
to chase sensory pleasure.

47
00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:49.208
Just as a person retires

48
00:02:49.208 --> 00:02:52.291
from active service,

49
00:02:52.291 --> 00:02:57.333
they retire from the compulsion
of sensory enjoyment.

50
00:02:57.333 --> 00:03:00.666
Dvandvair vimuktah sukha-duhkha-samjnaih –

51
00:03:00.666 --> 00:03:01.666
those who are freed from the

52
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:03.916
ups and downs of pleasure and pain.

53
00:03:03.916 --> 00:03:07.000
They do not get swept away
in fleeting emotions,

54
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:10.250
but remain steady.

55
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.875
And finally, such seekers are called amudha –

56
00:03:14.875 --> 00:03:15.750
those who

57
00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.583
are no longer bewildered by this world.

58
00:03:19.583 --> 00:03:21.250
They can clearly see

59
00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:22.875
what is eternal

60
00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:25.583
and what is merely passing.

61
00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:28.625
And thus such unbewildered souls

62
00:03:28.625 --> 00:03:31.583
attain padam-avyayam –

63
00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:36.125
the eternal abode from which there is no return.

64
00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:37.625
This is the supreme goal –

65
00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:40.708
where the soul attains lasting peace,

66
00:03:40.708 --> 00:03:45.708
joy, and the divine shelter of the Lord.

67
00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:53.000
Do you sometimes feel that

68
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.125
the constant effort to prove yourself

69
00:03:57.125 --> 00:04:00.000
is what exhausts you?

70
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.916
Trying to appear strong in every situation,

71
00:04:02.916 --> 00:04:04.375
giving the impression

72
00:04:04.375 --> 00:04:10.000
that everything is in control –

73
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.625
even when it is not within.

74
00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:16.291
This is the weight of ego –

75
00:04:16.291 --> 00:04:19.041
and this is where the real

76
00:04:19.041 --> 00:04:23.125
problem begins.

77
00:04:23.125 --> 00:04:27.000
When you put down this weight

78
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.291
and accept –

79
00:04:30.291 --> 00:04:33.458
‘I do not need to be perfect’ –

80
00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:37.708
a new space opens within

81
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:42.541
where real progress becomes possible.

82
00:04:42.541 --> 00:04:46.625
I have said – the path to freedom

83
00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:50.166
begins with humility.

84
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:53.291
When you give up pretence,

85
00:04:53.291 --> 00:04:57.166
only then does real healing begin.

86
00:04:57.166 --> 00:04:59.500
And from this honesty,

87
00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:03.333
you slowly begin to let go –

88
00:05:03.333 --> 00:05:07.250
old habits, deep attachments,

89
00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:12.041
and the illusion that happiness
lies in outer things.

90
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:15.208
The world will still pull at you –

91
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:19.958
joy and sorrow, victory and defeat.

92
00:05:19.958 --> 00:05:21.416
But

93
00:05:21.416 --> 00:05:23.041
the more stable

94
00:05:23.041 --> 00:05:25.666
you become within,

95
00:05:25.666 --> 00:05:30.125
the less these affect you.

96
00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:34.083
You do not need to understand everything.

97
00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:39.041
Just take one sincere step each time.

98
00:05:39.041 --> 00:05:43.375
That step slowly frees you –

99
00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:47.708
and also makes you stronger from within.

100
00:05:47.708 --> 00:05:48.791
Reflect on this.

101
00:05:53.416 --> 00:05:56.791
In families, it often happens

102
00:05:56.791 --> 00:05:59.458
that we say –

103
00:05:59.458 --> 00:06:03.083
‘I care about my family.’

104
00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:08.000
But slowly ego finds its place within –

105
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.916
always needing to be proven right,

106
00:06:09.916 --> 00:06:13.166
expecting everyone to accept your opinion,

107
00:06:13.166 --> 00:06:16.791
or digging in during arguments.

108
00:06:16.791 --> 00:06:19.541
These small things quietly

109
00:06:19.541 --> 00:06:23.333
grow the distance between hearts.

110
00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:24.625
But the moment one

111
00:06:24.625 --> 00:06:28.000
person gives up ego –

112
00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.166
the whole home begins to change.

113
00:06:30.166 --> 00:06:32.208
The path to peace

114
00:06:32.208 --> 00:06:36.541
begins with nirmana-moh – that is,

115
00:06:36.541 --> 00:06:40.708
becoming free from ego and delusion.

116
00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:45.333
In the family, humility is not weakness –

117
00:06:45.333 --> 00:06:49.666
it is strength. It is the courage to say –

118
00:06:49.666 --> 00:06:52.458
‘Perhaps I was wrong’

119
00:06:52.458 --> 00:06:57.833
or ‘your feelings matter too.’

120
00:06:57.833 --> 00:07:00.375
It is the quiet power

121
00:07:00.375 --> 00:07:04.291
that listens without interrupting and forgives

122
00:07:04.291 --> 00:07:07.416
without keeping score.

123
00:07:07.416 --> 00:07:09.833
When even one person

124
00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:12.500
in the family becomes humble –

125
00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:15.416
arguments grow smaller,

126
00:07:15.416 --> 00:07:17.958
understanding deepens,

127
00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:21.791
children learn to speak with respect,

128
00:07:21.791 --> 00:07:25.583
and elders feel

129
00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:28.750
that their words are being heard.

130
00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:33.125
Humility does not only maintain peace –

131
00:07:33.125 --> 00:07:36.125
it also creates real love.

132
00:07:36.125 --> 00:07:39.500
So give up ego –

133
00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.916
and see

134
00:07:40.916 --> 00:07:45.166
how your home begins to change from within.

135
00:07:49.916 --> 00:07:52.958
At the workplace it is often said –

136
00:07:52.958 --> 00:07:57.416
‘Be confident, dominate everything.’

137
00:07:57.416 --> 00:07:59.541
But the truth is

138
00:07:59.541 --> 00:08:00.333
that many times

139
00:08:00.333 --> 00:08:04.916
behind confidence hides -

140
00:08:04.916 --> 00:08:06.583
ego.

141
00:08:06.583 --> 00:08:08.708
And when ego takes over,

142
00:08:08.708 --> 00:08:12.791
real communication breaks down.

143
00:08:12.791 --> 00:08:14.666
You stop listening,

144
00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:19.291
you get into defending yourself,

145
00:08:19.291 --> 00:08:20.416
and you focus

146
00:08:20.416 --> 00:08:22.333
more on being proven right

147
00:08:22.333 --> 00:08:26.041
than on doing the right thing.

148
00:08:26.041 --> 00:08:29.708
This is where problems begin –

149
00:08:29.708 --> 00:08:30.833
not from a lack of skill,

150
00:08:30.833 --> 00:08:32.791
but from a lack of perspective.

151
00:08:32.791 --> 00:08:35.708
The path to true freedom

152
00:08:35.708 --> 00:08:38.958
begins with nirmana-moh –

153
00:08:38.958 --> 00:08:42.375
letting go of ego.

154
00:08:42.375 --> 00:08:45.458
At the workplace, this very humility

155
00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:48.500
becomes a hidden strength.

156
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.583
A humble leader listens deeply,

157
00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:55.083
welcomes feedback,

158
00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:58.416
and gives others space to grow.

159
00:08:58.416 --> 00:09:00.583
A humble colleague

160
00:09:00.583 --> 00:09:04.916
places collaboration above credit.

161
00:09:04.916 --> 00:09:09.291
Humility quiets the mental noise

162
00:09:09.291 --> 00:09:11.375
born of comparison, defensiveness,

163
00:09:11.375 --> 00:09:14.333
and control.

164
00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:17.833
It allows you to respond rather than react –

165
00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:20.125
to seek solutions

166
00:09:20.125 --> 00:09:24.458
rather than assign blame.

167
00:09:24.458 --> 00:09:29.125
If you wish to be a true leader,

168
00:09:29.125 --> 00:09:32.708
step down from the seat of ego

169
00:09:32.708 --> 00:09:35.333
and begin from there.

170
00:09:35.333 --> 00:09:38.083
People do not follow titles –

171
00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:41.125
they follow trust.

172
00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:45.083
And trust begins with humility.

173
00:09:45.083 --> 00:09:48.375
Employees too flourish

174
00:09:48.375 --> 00:09:53.125
when it is the humility of the leader

175
00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:56.000
that comes forward – not the ego.

176
00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.166
Reflect on this.
